id: absolute-chaos
name: Absolute Chaos
order: 1
category: body
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait - Secondary, then, unless it names a Primary one to replace.
importance: secondary
# (1), (4) Pure Form and Internalized Chaos given (racial.mjs grantsTransformation).
grantsTransformation: pure-form, internalized-chaos
# (2), (3) Its Aspects, given by name (transformations.mjs aspectsGivenTo) - Natural (LV1) Mastered, a level more Fully Mastered.
grantsAspectTo: Pure Form = Prelude; Pure Form = Natural (LV1) if mastered; Pure Form = Natural (LV1) if fully mastered
# (4) Pure Form in the Pure Majin Line, its 1st Stage over Internalized Chaos (transformations.mjs lineOf).
addsToLine: Pure Form = pure-majin 1
description: >
  You are a being of primordial chaos, inherently unpredictable.
text: >
  Absolute Chaos (Body): You are a being of primordial chaos, inherently unpredictable.
  (1)-[Passive]: Upon gaining access to this Factor, gain access to the Pure Form Transformation.
  (2)-[Passive]: Pure Form gains the Prelude Aspect.
  (3)-[Passive]: Upon mastering Pure Form, it gains the Natural (LV1) Aspect. Increase the level of this Aspect by 1 if it is Fully Mastered.
  (4)-[Passive]: Pure Form becomes part of the Pure Majin Transformation Line, with Internalized Chaos as its Null Stage, and you gain access to that Null Stage.

---

# All of it in its header: Pure Form and Internalized Chaos given, Prelude, Natural as it is Mastered, the Pure Majin Line.
